SUMMARY:The Choir of Man
DESCRIPTION:Olivier Award-nominated\, West End acclaimed\, and globally ado
 red — hundreds of thousands of fans across four continents can't be wron
 g — this is the show the whole world has been raising a glass to. Stunni
 ng harmonies and foot-stomping singalongs\, brimming with hits — all wit
 h a real bar on stage. A wildly talented cast of nine (extra)ordinary guys
  — world-class tap dancers\, slam poets\, multi-instrumentalists and pow
 erhouse singers — who serve it all\, live. Discover the worldwide smash 
 hit featuring music from artists such as Queen\, Sia\, Paul Simon\, Adele\
 , Luther Vandross\, Guns N’ Roses\, Avicii\, and Katy Perry\, to name ju
 st a few. From sell-out seasons at the Sydney Opera House to packed houses
  across the US\, Europe and Australia\, this show has conquered the globe 
 one pub at a time. An uplifting celebration of community and friendship\, 
 with something for everyone. Enjoy 75 minutes of foot-stomping entertainme
 nt\, including a 15-minute preshow\, unlike anything else. Location: Magic
  Mirrors Spiegeltent – Festival Village Brisbane Festival is an initiati
 ve of the Queensland Government and Brisbane City Council. Discover the fu
 ll 2026 festival program now via the Brisbane Festival website.
LOCATION:South Bank\, Brisbane City\, South Bank\, corner Ernest Street\, S
 tanley Street and Grey Street\, South Brisbane
